ant! &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;"><span class="autonumber"><span><b><span style="color: #dd1e31;" class="mcFormatColor">Important!</span></b></span></span>Publish offer note: This array is required and at least one image URL must be specified before an offer can be published to create an active listing.</p></span></div>
